<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2863_11255.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Maximilian</persName> landgraff zue
<lb n="2"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-222" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Stielingen</placeName>, kayl: mayt: und
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heyl</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roem</unclear>: reichs erb-
<lb n="4"/>marschall
<lb n="5"/>Unsern frl: gruß unnd wolgenaigten guthen
<lb n="6"/>wilen zuevor, edle, gestrenge, frome, ehrn-
<lb n="7"/>veste, fürsichtig, und weise, besonders liebe
<lb n="8"/>herrn und nachparn.
<lb n="9"/>Wier werden zue ainer ablaiß genoethigt, hewere
<lb n="10"/>zue unfrid, umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gulden</unclear>. 2000. oder
<lb n="11"/>1500. frücht an zuegreiffen, unnd solches lieber
<lb n="12"/>an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orth</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> unnd nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">marckt</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerloesen</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weile</unclear> wir dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>
